  "worked_solution": "Multiplying the matrices using the usual method, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5-\\text{i} \\\\ \\text{i} & -3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1-2\\text{i} & 1+2\\text{i} \\\\ -1 & 2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(1)(1-2\\text{i})+(5-\\text{i})(-1) & (1)(1+2\\text{i})+(5-\\text{i})(2\\text{i}) \\\\ (\\text{i})(1-2\\text{i})+(-3\\text{i})(-1) & (\\text{i})(1+2\\text{i})+(-3\\text{i})(2\\text{i})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(1-2\\text{i})+(-5+\\text{i}) & (1+2\\text{i})+(2+10\\text{i}) \\\\ (2+\\text{i})+(3\\text{i}) & (-2+\\text{i})+(6)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4-\\text{i} & 3+12\\text{i} \\\\ 2+4\\text{i} & 4+\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n.",
